<div class="screen" style="--accent: {{accent}}; height: 840px;">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>

  <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 48px 72px;">
    <div class="title" style="font-size: 22px;">TROIS DIRECTIONS</div>
    <div style="height: 14px;"></div>
    <div style="font-size: 19px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 900px;">Le même écran, trois humeurs. <span style="color: #ffd133;">La direction A est retenue</span> — les deux autres restent ici comme trace de ce qui a été écarté, et pourquoi.</div>

    <div style="height: 32px;"></div>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start;">

      <!-- ============ A — Ambre nuit ============ -->
      <div style="flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 15px; color: #ffd133;">A</span>
          <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">Ambre nuit</span>
          <span style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #12161f; background: #ffd133; padding: 5px 8px;">RETENUE</span>
        </div>
        <div style="height: 14px;"></div>

        <div style="height: 300px; background: #12161f; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 -4px 0 #0a0d13, 0 4px 0 #0a0d13, -4px 0 0 #0a0d13, 4px 0 0 #0a0d13;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 48px; background: #151b28; box-shadow: inset 0 6px 0 #232c40;"></div>
          <div style="position: absolute; right: 26px; top: 26px; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #e8ebf5;"></div>
          <div style="padding: 30px 26px;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 17px; color: #ffd133; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0a0d13; line-height: 1.5;">PROJECT<br>GAMING</div>
            <div style="height: 22px;"></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffd133; background: rgba(255,209,51,.10); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,209,51,.30); padding: 5px 10px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 5 8" width="12" height="19" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="0" width="2" height="8" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="2" y="1" width="1" height="6" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="3" y="2" width="1" height="4" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="4" y="3" width="1" height="2" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg>
              <span>Continuer</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #8b93a7; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Nouvelle partie</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #8b93a7; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Choisir un niveau</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #8b93a7; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Options</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height: 16px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: #f2f2ff;">Pourquoi.</span> Continuité totale avec l'existant : c'est votre bleu-nuit et votre ambre, seulement rendus en pixel art. Chaleureux, lisible, sans risque.</div>
        <div style="height: 10px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: var(--muted);">Le prix.</span> C'est aussi la moins mémorable des trois. Personne ne reconnaîtra le jeu à sa capture d'écran.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ B — Cyan cathodique ============ -->
      <div style="flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 15px; color: #62e8ff;">B</span>
          <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);">Cyan cathodique</span>
          <span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--dim);">écartée</span>
        </div>
        <div style="height: 14px;"></div>

        <div style="opacity: .45; height: 300px; background: #05070c; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 -4px 0 #000, 0 4px 0 #000, -4px 0 0 #000, 4px 0 0 #000;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 48px; background: #0a1219; box-shadow: inset 0 6px 0 #14303c;"></div>
          <div style="position: absolute; right: 26px; top: 26px; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #62e8ff;"></div>
          <div style="padding: 30px 26px;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 17px; color: #dff6ff; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0d5a6e; line-height: 1.5;">PROJECT<br>GAMING</div>
            <div style="height: 22px;"></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #05070c; background: #62e8ff; padding: 5px 10px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 5 8" width="12" height="19" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="0" width="2" height="8" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="2" y="1" width="1" height="6" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="3" y="2" width="1" height="4" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="4" y="3" width="1" height="2" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg>
              <span>Continuer</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #6d8a97; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Nouvelle partie</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #6d8a97; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Choisir un niveau</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #6d8a97; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Options</div>
          </div>
          <!-- Lignes de balayage : le seul effet du lot, et il est purement CSS. -->
          <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,.32) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);"></div>
        </div>

        <div style="height: 16px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: #f2f2ff;">Pourquoi.</span> Le plus caractérisé. Noir profond, cyan froid, lignes de balayage : on sait en une seconde qu'on est devant un jeu, pas devant un logiciel.</div>
        <div style="height: 10px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: var(--muted);">Le prix.</span> Les lignes de balayage fatiguent sur de longues sessions, et le froid va mal aux écrans de fin de niveau, qui doivent être accueillants.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ C — Néon arcade ============ -->
      <div style="flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 15px; color: #ff4fa3;">C</span>
          <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);">Néon arcade</span>
          <span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--dim);">écartée</span>
        </div>
        <div style="height: 14px;"></div>

        <div style="opacity: .45; height: 300px; background: #150c22; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 -4px 0 #07040c, 0 4px 0 #07040c, -4px 0 0 #07040c, 4px 0 0 #07040c;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 48px; background: #1e1130; box-shadow: inset 0 6px 0 #3a2059;"></div>
          <div style="position: absolute; right: 26px; top: 26px; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #4fe0ff;"></div>
          <div style="padding: 30px 26px;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size: 17px; color: #ff4fa3; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #4fe0ff; line-height: 1.5;">PROJECT<br>GAMING</div>
            <div style="height: 22px;"></div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #ff4fa3; background: rgba(255,79,163,.14); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #ff4fa3; padding: 5px 10px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 5 8" width="12" height="19" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="0" width="2" height="8" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="2" y="1" width="1" height="6" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="3" y="2" width="1" height="4" fill="currentColor"></rect><rect x="4" y="3" width="1" height="2" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg>
              <span>Continuer</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #9a7fb5; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Nouvelle partie</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #9a7fb5; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Choisir un niveau</div>
            <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #9a7fb5; padding: 5px 10px 5px 32px;">Options</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height: 16px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: #f2f2ff;">Pourquoi.</span> Deux accents complémentaires — magenta et cyan — sur un violet profond. Le seul des trois qui donne au jeu une couleur signature.</div>
        <div style="height: 10px;"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.65;"><span style="color: var(--muted);">Le prix.</span> Deux accents, c'est deux fois plus de règles à tenir : il faut décider une bonne fois lequel dit « action » et lequel dit « information ».</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
